            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Arizona Desert Flower"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It was nice...a little too sweet for me and the triple sec overpowered everything. If I made it again, I would definitely decrease the triple sec--maybe use add'l fresh squeezed lime juice. Use freshly squeezed pink grapefruit juice--it really ramps up the 'fresh' flavor!",
